# Development-only tooling: the .ods importer is not part of the running app and
# ships no entry point, so it is kept out of the image. Nothing under app/ imports
# it — the shared name-normalization helper lives in app/services/naming.py.
app/importer/
DEPLOY.md
CLAUDE.md
# README.md is intentionally NOT ignored: pyproject declares
# `readme = "README.md"`, so hatchling needs it in the build context to build
# the app wheel (uv sync's project-install step). Excluding it fails the build.
